          <declname>transaction_data</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Handle PREPARE request (2PC Phase 1). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_shard_r_p_c_server_1_1_request_handler" kindref="compound">ShardRPCServer::RequestHandler</ref> interface ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</para>
<para>Validates operations, acquires locks, writes PREPARE_TX to WAL, and returns VOTE_COMMIT (true) or VOTE_ABORT (false). Idempotent: a duplicate PREPARE for the same txn_id returns the same vote as the original call without re-locking. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>transaction_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Globale Transaktions-ID. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>coordinator_shard_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Coordinator-Identifikator fuer Nachvollziehbarkeit. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>transaction_data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Serialisiertes JSON mit Teilnehmeroperationen. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true fuer VOTE_COMMIT, false fuer VOTE_ABORT.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">transaction_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Identifier of the transaction. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">coordinator_shard_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Identifier of the coordinator shard. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">transaction_data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
