    <briefdescription>
<para>Shard-side participant in a Two-Phase Commit protocol. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Attach to a <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_shard_r_p_c_server" kindref="compound">ShardRPCServer</ref> via setRequestHandler() to handle incoming PREPARE/COMMIT/ABORT messages from the coordinator.</para>
<para>All state transitions are written to a WAL before the response is sent, ensuring that a crash between phases can be recovered on restart. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
